# Cloudflare API token (scoped, least-privilege).
# Create at: My Profile > API Tokens > Create Token (Custom token).
# Grant ONLY: Zone > Zone (Read), Zone > DNS (Edit), Zone > Email Routing Rules (Edit).
# Scope it under "Zone Resources" to the specific zone(s) you manage.
# Never use the Global API Key.
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
